Hello everyone,
Since kernel version 6.17, the bass speaker on my Lenovo Yoga 7 no longer
works.
After contacting TI support, they told me that the problem is likely caused
by the Realtek codec.
My configuration is attached.
Mr Shenghao Ding (TI) sent me a bypass script to test, and after running
the script, the bass speakers are working. The script is also attached.

I am grateful for your assistance.

Best regards,
Georg

